{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><div class=\"incontent\" id=\"blockcontent\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Article\">\n<div class=\"colleft mt-1\" id=\"date\">\n<p class=\"date\" itemprop=\"datePublished\">發布日期   2026年11月19日 18:28 星期四</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"upper\"><p>今日（19日）下午4時許，警方接報有人於深涌碼頭附近踩單車時受傷暈倒。救援人員到場搜索，發現約60歲男傷者昏迷，事主由政府飛行服務隊直升機送往東區醫院搶救。醫院所見，事主左邊額頭近眼角流血。</p></div>\n<div id=\"lower\">\n<div class=\"articlelogin\"><p>據了解，事主與朋友一行三人由深涌碼頭踩單車往榕樹澳方向，其間發生意外，暫未知事主暈倒原因。</p></div><p>相關字詞﹕踩單車 </p> </div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T10:52:22.938730+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":179,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T10:28:16+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T12:10:21.011954+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T10:45:48.755066+00:00","content_hash":"4325640d0cb0a12c72c9428742b54ec20dfeb408e26dbd817dd132ebeb7487fd","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}